  "body": "Added `pricePerWeek`, `pricePerMonth`, `pricePerYear` and string variants of them. Based on https://github.com/RevenueCat/purchases-ios/pull/3546\r\n\r\n**Edits by @JayShortway:**\r\n- Added variants for Android, iOS and Typescript.\r\n- This seems to be all that's needed for [React Native](https://github.com/RevenueCat/react-native-purchases/pull/1045) and [Kotlin Multiplatform](https://github.com/RevenueCat/purchases-kmp/pull/131), but I didn't check other hybrids yet. Please let me know if you see something that wont work in a certain hybrid. ",
